# Sprite source-of-truth: the 64x64 RGBA PNGs in assets/sprites/ ARE the source
# from which sprites.cpp is generated. They MUST be committed alongside
# sprites.cpp for reproducible builds + a meaningful drift gate. Keep them
# tracked even if a broader rule above ever starts matching PNGs.
!assets/sprites/
!assets/sprites/*.png
